  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Bank and Gaza Communications and Outreach Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this contract is to support USAIDs programs to improve the lives of Palestinian people to advance conditions that can contribute to an eventual two-state solution. This contract will help USAID build relationships with the Palestinian community and increase public awareness and disseminate information about USAID assistance to both Palestinian and global audiences. The aim is to promote a better understanding, appreciation, and sustained support for USAIDs foreign assistance among all stakeholders both in and outside of the West Bank and Gaza. The objectives are: Raise understanding and awareness about U.S. foreign assistance abroad; Convey to Palestinian audiences the positive impact USAID activities have to improve the lives of the Palestinian people; Inform American and global audiences about the positive impact of U.S. foreign assistance; and Support outreach and communications of USAIDs programs and activities that improve the lives of the Palestinian people. The Contractor will support the Mission by producing visual communications products and supporting engagement and events related to Mission programs/projects/activities and promoting a better understanding of USAID programs, projects, and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
